%\label{obs:nbr-of-pendant-vertex-in-sol}
%Consider a vertex $v$ which is adjacent with a pendant vertex (i.e. a vertex of degree~1) in $G$.
%If $S$ is a locating-dominating set of $G$,
%then there is a locating-dominating set $S'$ of $G$
