| Profile field | Value |
|---|---|
| Track | **B — no-tool compression** |
| Native domain | `number_theory` |
| Object regime | `integer_lattice` |
| Computational core | `subset_sum` (signed ideal-class relation) |
| Certificate | `integer_tuple` of form orientations |
