The module is built and the planted certificate is verified by exact sums, coverage, and injective bit signatures—`verify` never reads the stored answer. The long-running check now is the mandated 200,000-sample structure-aware density test; candidates are already valid partitions into triples, so the estimate is against the solver’s real search language rather than arbitrary noise.
