+NOTES = r"""
+Definition and source results.  The Introduction defines Test Cover as follows:
+given items U and tests F subseteq 2^U, select at most k tests so that every
+pair of items occurs differently in at least one selected test.  Section 3
+represents it by the natural red-test/blue-item auxiliary bipartite graph.
