codex
The two G9 harness runs were also attempted in isolated directories as required, but all calls received the same account-level 403 before any model attempt could count. I’ve kept those harness-owned error transcripts as evidence and marked all three arms as 0 valid attempts—not 0/3 solved. I’m finishing the reproducible local report and README with this external limitation prominent; this is a blocked hardening audit, not a claimed oracle pass or a rejection of the paper.
