+"""Verified Test Cover certificate generator for arXiv:2411.17948.
+
+The module inverse-generates a strict 3-partition, regards every target-sum
+triple as a red vertex of Red-Blue Dominating Set, and carries the held
+partition through the paper's Section 5 reduction to Test Cover.  A submitted
+partition is a compact name for the selected core tests; all forced bit tests
+are added by the decoder.
+"""
