+Attacks. Support-size outliers are neutralized exactly. Greedy coordinate
+novelty, bounded random restarts, and a single-anchor cyclic ansatz all fail on
+the measured panel. The last is deliberately close to the intended symmetry
+but commits to the first displayed decoy instead of locating the collective
+orbit. Full Gaussian elimination is reported separately as the successful
+Track-B reference algorithm.
 
